{"connection_id": "BC-8d2acc6e43359151b507", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.2.11", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "hatred blinds", "note": "The commentary permits loss as blindness; the letter says hatred places a person in darkness and blinds his eyes, giving moral action a visual consequence."}
{"connection_id": "BC-f2e4c310699388862fc1", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.2.3", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "obedience verifies knowledge", "note": "The commentary seeks certainty after faith; the letter says keeping God's commandments is how believers know they know him."}
{"connection_id": "BC-afe92636c8c7aaa53a0f", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.3.18", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "truth enacted", "note": "The commentary's truth must be conveyed by those doing good; the letter calls for love in deed and truth rather than word or speech alone."}
{"connection_id": "BC-dd7301eff7672e875489", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.3.19", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "deeds ground assurance", "note": "The commentary culminates in being certain of truth; the letter says active love lets believers know they are of the truth and reassure their hearts."}
{"connection_id": "BC-7b08750c5a822db95773", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.4.1", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "test before believing", "note": "The commentary cites checking a report before accepting it; First John says not to believe every spirit but to test the spirits to see whether they are from God. It applies verification to religious claims."}
{"connection_id": "BC-f0540228a523cf64b486", "ref": "SBLGNT:1John.4.1", "target": "sec8", "tradition": "incil", "kind": "motif", "basis": "test claimed spirits", "note": "The commentary says incoming news must be examined; the letter commands believers not to trust every spirit but test them because false prophets have gone out."}

